@Vigiloom.Web_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### List Agent packages (signed-in monitoring user or authorized API credential).
GET {{Vigiloom.Web_HostAddress}}/api/v1/agent-packages?page=1
Accept: application/json

### Download a GitHub release to the central library (Administrator session and antiforgery token).
POST {{Vigiloom.Web_HostAddress}}/api/v1/agent-packages/cache
Content-Type: application/json
RequestVerificationToken: {{AntiforgeryToken}}

{"version":"1.0.0","runtimeIdentifier":"win-x64"}

### Agent retrieves its assigned package manifest over HTTPS.
GET {{Vigiloom.Web_HostAddress}}/api/v1/agent/update/targets/{{ManifestSha256}}.json
Authorization: Bearer {{AgentCredential}}
